@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    ViewData["Description"] =  "Read the Privacy Policy of RatPDF. Our browser-based tools process files locally and we do not store, collect, or retain your uploaded documents or personal data.";
}
<head>
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-2855035251823717"
            crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</head>
<div class="card p-4">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        Your privacy is extremely important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>RatPDF</strong>
        ("we", "our", or "the website") handles information when you use our online PDF tools.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our services are designed with privacy in mind. All file processing is performed directly in your
        browser and <strong>we do not store, collect, or retain your files on our servers</strong>.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>1. File Processing & Storage</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF provides browser-based tools for processing PDF files. When you upload a file to use our tools:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Your files are processed directly within your browser.</li>
        <li>The file processing occurs temporarily in your device memory.</li>
        <li>Processed files are immediately made available for download.</li>
        <li>Once the process is complete, the data is automatically removed from memory.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        <strong>We do not upload, store, copy, or retain any files on our servers.</strong>
    </p>

    <p>
        Our system does <strong>not store files in any server folders, databases, or storage systems.</strong>
        We do not keep backups, logs, or archives of user documents.
    </p>

    <p>
        In simple terms:
        <strong>0% of your files are stored by us — not temporarily, not partially, and not permanently.</strong>
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>2. No File Database or Document Storage</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF does not maintain any database containing user documents or uploaded files.
        Our website is designed strictly as a processing interface that allows users to perform file operations
        such as:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>PDF conversion</li>
        <li>PDF compression</li>
        <li>PDF merging</li>
        <li>PDF splitting</li>
        <li>PDF editing tools</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        All operations occur on the user's device, ensuring complete privacy and control over your files.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>3. Personal Information</h3>

    <p>
        We do <strong>not collect personal information from uploaded documents</strong> because files are never transmitted to our servers.
    </p>

    <p>
        We may only collect limited technical information necessary for maintaining website performance, such as:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Anonymous usage statistics</li>
        <li>Device or browser type</li>
        <li>General traffic analytics</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        This information is used solely to improve the functionality and performance of the website.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>4. Cookies & Advertising</h3>

    <p>
        Our website may use cookies or similar technologies to improve the browsing experience.
    </p>

    <p>
        We may also use third-party services such as advertising networks (for example, Google AdSense)
        that may use cookies to display relevant advertisements to users.
    </p>

    <p>
        These third-party providers may collect anonymous data in accordance with their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>5. Data Security</h3>

    <p>
        Security and privacy are core principles of our platform. Our security approach includes:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Local browser-based file processing</li>
        <li>No file uploads to servers</li>
        <li>No database storage of documents</li>
        <li>HTTPS encrypted website connections</li>
        <li>Secure content delivery</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Because files never leave your device, the risk of server-side data exposure is eliminated.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>6. Compliance with Privacy Regulations</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF is designed with modern privacy standards in mind and aims to comply with applicable
        privacy frameworks including:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)</li>
        <li>California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</li>
        <li>General online privacy and transparency standards</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Since we do not store or process personal files on our servers, users maintain full control
        over their data at all times.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>7. Third-Party Links</h3>

    <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible
        for the privacy practices of those external sites. We encourage users to review their
        privacy policies before sharing any information.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>8. Children's Privacy</h3>

    <p>
        Our services are not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect
        personal information from children.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>9. Updates to This Privacy Policy</h3>

    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect improvements to our services
        or regulatory requirements. Updates will be posted on this page with the revised date.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>10. Contact Us</h3>

    <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices,
        you may contact us through the website contact page.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> @DateTime.Now.Year</p>

</div>